@startuml
title Khoj — IIITA Lost & Found: Key Workflow Activity Diagrams

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

|Student Finder|
start
:Find an item on campus;
:Sign in using verified @iiita.ac.in account;
:Open "Report a Found Item" form;
:Fill details (title, category, location, date);
:Attach photograph of the item;
if (Is file <= 5MB and valid image type?) then (yes)
  :Submit found item report;
  |System|
  :Upload photo to public bucket 'item-photos';
  :Insert item record with status 'ACTIVE';
  :Post item on Campus Noticeboard;
  |Student Finder|
  :Receive confirmation and view item listing;
  stop
else (no)
  :Display file validation error;
  stop
endif

|Claimant Student|
start
:Browse noticeboard or search keywords;
:Identify lost belonging;
:Click "Claim This Item";
:Provide ownership explanation and secret proof marks;
:Attach invoice / proof picture (optional);
:Submit claim;
|System|
:Check UNIQUE(item_id, claimant_id);
:Upload proof to private bucket 'claim-evidence';
:Insert claim with status 'PENDING_REVIEW';
:Send alert notification to Finder;
|Campus Administrator|
:Open Admin Claims Desk;
:Inspect claimant profile & confidential proof dossier;
if (Is proof valid and authentic?) then (yes)
  :Approve claim;
  |System|
  :Set claim status to 'AWAITING_HANDOVER';
  :Set item status to 'CLAIMED';
  :Reject competing pending claims for same item;
  :Insert record in audit_logs;
  :Notify claimant to visit desk;
else (no)
  |Campus Administrator|
  :Reject claim with explanation;
  |System|
  :Set claim status to 'REJECTED';
  :Insert record in audit_logs;
  :Notify claimant of rejection;
  stop
endif

|Claimant Student|
:Visit Administrative / Security Desk with physical IIITA ID;
|Campus Administrator|
:Verify student ID card and roll number;
:Click "Confirm Physical Handover";
:Input verified recipient name and roll number;
|System|
:Set claim status to 'RETURNED';
:Set item status to 'RETURNED';
:Write permanent handover audit record;
:Dispatch completion notifications;
|Claimant Student|
:Take custody of item;
stop

@enduml
